ocked by PLAB-9\nPR #42 · design doc"}, {"id": "act", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 455, "width": 580, "height": 90, "backgroundColor": "#f1f3f5", "strokeColor": "#5b6b7f", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "fontFamily": "helvetica", "fontSize": 13, "text": "Activity (อัตโนมัติ)\n<YOUR_NAME> เปลี่ยน state Todo → In Progress · เมื่อ 2 ชม. ก่อน\n<TEAMMATE> comment: \"ใช้ token แบบ one-time ดีกว่า\""}, {"type": "rectangle", "x": 700, "y": 80, "width": 480, "height": 480, "backgroundColor": "#e3fafc", "strokeColor": "#0b7285", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "dashed", "roughness": 0}, {"type": "text", "x": 720, "y": 92, "text": "ทำไมมืออาชีพต้องเขียนแบบนี้", "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": "helvetica", "strokeColor": "#0b7285"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "rectangle", "x": 720, "y": 130, "width": 440, "height": 70, "backgroundColor": "#ffffff", "strokeColor": "#0b7285", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "fontFamily": "helvetica", "fontSize": 14, "text": "Title = ผลลัพธ์ที่ผู้ใช้ได้ ไม่ใช่งานที่ทำ\n(ทดสอบได้ · จบได้)"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "rectangle", "x": 720, "y": 215, "width": 440, "height": 70, "backgroundColor": "#ffffff", "strokeColor": "#0b7285", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "fontFamily": "helvetica", "fontSize": 14, "text": "Acceptance criteria = Definition of Done\nระดับใบงาน → ลดการตีความคนละแบบ"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "rectangle", "x": 720, "y": 300, "width": 440, "height": 70, "backgroundColor": "#ffffff", "strokeColor": "#0b7285", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "fontFamily": "helvetica", "fontSize": 14, "text": "Estimate + Priority = ความซื่อสัตย์ต่อแผน\n(หลักการ Management ในจรรยาบรรณ)"}, {"id": "r4", "type": "rectangle", "x": 720, "y": 385, "width": 440, "height": 70, "backgroundColor": "#ffffff", "strokeColor": "#0b7285", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "fontFamily": "helvetica", "fontSize": 14, "text": "Links/Relations = traceability\nโจทย์ ↔ โค้ด ↔ รีวิว ↔ release"}, {"id": "r5", "type": "rectangle", "x": 720, "y": 470, "width": 440, "height": 70, "backgroundColor": "#ffffff", "strokeColor": "#0b7285", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "fontFamily": "helvetica", "fontSize": 14, "text": "Activity log = ความโปร่งใส\nใครตัดสินใจอะไร เมื่อไร ทำไม"}]